<title>CANADA: Agrium Inc Q1 share profit falls.</title>
<headline>Agrium Inc Q1 share profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			  1996</p>
<p> Shr			US$0.14		  US$0.20</p>
<p> Net			 18,700		   26,900</p>
<p> Revs		     290,348		  317,531</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 138,808		  142,840</p>
<p>		  (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Earnings per share above are in basic terms and include discontinued operations in 1996. Fully diluted earnings per share in the first quarter of 1997 were US$0.14 and in 1996 were US$0.19.</p>
<p>Company full name is Agrium Inc.</p>
